      "id": "claim_9d5132df20574f58a63cd17c359d4398",
      "statement": "The trip-research agent is a separate deepagents graph built once in lifespan on the chat graph's store and checkpointer inside its own try/except; a build failure leaves research_agent None (routes 503) without affecting the chat graph, and a success sweeps stale runs and publishes the agent and bus to a runtime holder the chat node reads.",
